Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 14:25:35 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 032/207] deepseek: list the forward's 2,048-row prefill
 variants under TF_DSV41_PF_4K

With PF_4K the forward keeps 2,048-row segments (the per-piece fallback and a
first start run them through a 4,096-row staging ring), but aot-needs listed
only the 4K segments' variants. The served flash17 pack then failed its first
operation on rank 0 and rank 1 with no captured _kv_store for RING 4096.
As the recipe engine does, the prompt passes (segments, piece runs, images and
CED replay's decoder) now run again at the default prefill rows under PF_4K.
